### 重复注册：应返回“用户名已存在”
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "999999"
}

### 密码错误：应返回“用户名或密码错误”
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "999999"
}

### 登录张三
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

